{"t": 1791684907.779767, "event": "supplier_reply", "case": "case:P08", "supplier": "sup:70710", "message": {"thread_id": "thread:P08:70710", "message_id": "msg:70710-1-2", "in_reply_to": null, "from": "sales@70710", "from_name": "Inside Sales, Edelstahl-Service Donautal GmbH", "to": "Hollerau Pumpenwerke GmbH", "subject": "Re: Alloy surcharge and base price for 1.4404 bar", "body": "Dear customer,\n\nWe have reviewed your offer and can adjust our Angebot as follows. We welcome your commitment to a 24-month contract and have factored the verified volume into our calculation. We have accommodated your request for 90-day payment terms, bringing our proposed unit price to €5.57. For a 24-month agreement, we must include the AS-14404 index clause, as a fixed price over this duration is not feasible. \n\nOur standard Zahlungsziel is 30 days net. A binding higher volume would help us and can improve the price. Which volume can you commit to? We can offer a Preisgleitklausel on AS-14404, AS-14404, AS-14404.\n\nTo summarize, our current offer is a price of €5.57 per unit, Zahlungsziel 90 days net, a contract term of 24 months, a Preisgleitklausel on AS-14404. Our offer stays valid for 30 days.\n\nMit freundlichen Grüßen\nGeorg Aigner\nInside Sales, Edelstahl-Service Donautal GmbH", "attachments": [], "term_sheets": [{"term_sheet_id": "offer:70710-1", "terms": {"unit_price": 5.57, "payment_days": 90, "index_clause": {"series": "AS-14404", "material_share": 0.45, "deadband_pct": 0.0, "base_month": "2026-08"}, "contract_months": 24}}], "refs": [], "action": null, "status": "open", "signals": {"reply_delay_days": 1, "validity_days": 30}, "missing_fields": [], "claim_results": [{"index": 0, "result": "verified"}]}}
