{"t": 1791684942.542651, "event": "supplier_reply", "case": "case:P08", "supplier": "sup:70710", "message": {"thread_id": "thread:P08:70710", "message_id": "msg:70710-3-6", "in_reply_to": null, "from": "sales@70710", "from_name": "Inside Sales, Edelstahl-Service Donautal GmbH", "to": "Hollerau Pumpenwerke GmbH", "subject": "Re: Alloy surcharge and base price for 1.4404 bar", "body": "Dear customer,\n\nWe have reviewed your offer and can adjust our Angebot as follows. We checked the index change data you cited; it holds, but it does not change our calculation. That is not our reality: our AS-14404 is covered at fixed prices until March 2027, so that fall does not reach our cost. We acknowledge the recent drop in the AS-14404 index; however, our material is covered at fixed prices until March 2027, meaning this decrease does not reduce our current costs. \n\nAS-14404 rose 5.9 % in twelve months and is 45 % of our cost. That remains. LCI-C rose 2.7 % in twelve months and is 5 % of our cost. That remains. PPI-C2431 rose 12.3 % in twelve months and is 38 % of our cost. That remains. Our price follows our main cost drivers: AS-14404, PPI-C2431, LCI-C. Material accounts for about 45 % of our cost; more detail we do not share.\n\nWe are pleased to maintain the 90-day payment terms and the 24-month contract duration, but we must insist on the AS-14404 index clause for an agreement of this length. We can offer a Preisgleitklausel on AS-14404, AS-14404, AS-14404.\n\nOur current offer is a price of €5.35 per unit, Zahlungsziel 90 days net, a contract term of 24 months, a Preisgleitklausel on AS-14404. Alternatively, with a Preisgleitklausel on AS-14404: a price of €5.47 per unit, Zahlungsziel 90 days net, a contract term of 24 months, a Preisgleitklausel on AS-14404.\n\nThis offer is valid for 30 days.\n\nMit freundlichen Grüßen\nGeorg Aigner\nInside Sales, Edelstahl-Service Donautal GmbH", "attachments": [], "term_sheets": [{"term_sheet_id": "offer:70710-3", "terms": {"unit_price": 5.35, "payment_days": 90, "index_clause": {"series": "AS-14404", "material_share": 0.45, "deadband_pct": 0.0, "base_month": "2026-08"}, "contract_months": 24}}, {"term_sheet_id": "offer:70710-3-a", "terms": {"unit_price": 5.47, "payment_days": 90, "index_clause": {"series": "AS-14404", "material_share": 0.45, "deadband_pct": 5.0, "base_month": "2026-08"}, "contract_months": 24}}], "refs": [], "action": null, "status": "open", "signals": {"reply_delay_days": 1, "validity_days": 30}, "missing_fields": [], "claim_results": [{"index": 0, "result": "verified"}]}}
