{"t": 1791684965.6314712, "event": "supplier_reply", "case": "case:P08", "supplier": "sup:70710", "message": {"thread_id": "thread:P08:70710", "message_id": "msg:70710-4-8", "in_reply_to": null, "from": "sales@70710", "from_name": "Inside Sales, Edelstahl-Service Donautal GmbH", "to": "Hollerau Pumpenwerke GmbH", "subject": "Re: Alloy surcharge and base price for 1.4404 bar", "body": "Dear customer,\n\nThank you for your ongoing partnership with Edelstahl-Service Donautal GmbH. We always strive to provide you with the best service from our extensive product range.\n\nWe have verified the PPI-C2431 index decrease you cited and have adjusted our calculation accordingly. Our price follows our main cost drivers: AS-14404, PPI-C2431, LCI-C. Specifically, AS-14404 rose 5.9 % in twelve months and is 45 % of our cost. That remains. LCI-C rose 2.7 % in twelve months and is 5 % of our cost. That remains. Furthermore, PPI-C2431 rose 12.3 % in twelve months and is 38 % of our cost. That remains. As previously stated, a 24-month fixed price is not feasible, so we must include the AS-14404 index clause.\n\nThis is our final offer (letztes Angebot). Please decide. Our current Angebot is a price of €5.21 per unit, Zahlungsziel 90 days net, a contract term of 24 months, a Preisgleitklausel on AS-14404. Alternatively, with a Preisgleitklausel on AS-14404: a price of €5.33 per unit, Zahlungsziel 90 days net, a contract term of 24 months, a Preisgleitklausel on AS-14404.\n\nPlease note that this offer remains valid for 7 days.\n\nMit freundlichen Grüßen\nGeorg Aigner\nInside Sales, Edelstahl-Service Donautal GmbH", "attachments": [{"attachment_id": "att:70710-4-quote", "name": "quote-offer-70710-4.pdf", "type": "pdf", "content_b64": null}], "term_sheets": [{"term_sheet_id": "offer:70710-4", "terms": {"unit_price": 5.21, "payment_days": 90, "index_clause": {"series": "AS-14404", "material_share": 0.45, "deadband_pct": 0.0, "base_month": "2026-08"}, "contract_months": 24}}, {"term_sheet_id": "offer:70710-4-a", "terms": {"unit_price": 5.33, "payment_days": 90, "index_clause": {"series": "AS-14404", "material_share": 0.45, "deadband_pct": 5.0, "base_month": "2026-08"}, "contract_months": 24}}], "refs": [], "action": null, "status": "final_offer", "signals": {"reply_delay_days": 2, "validity_days": 7}, "missing_fields": [], "claim_results": [{"index": 0, "result": "verified"}]}}
